From e5d18e11546e551832d317c8e6d2db0a4e33e411 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mamam Kasir Dev <dev@mamamayam.local>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 03:11:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: Dompet ledger core (Cash Location + Cash Movement)
 per PRD
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Scope per user decision: full core ledger (Cash Location, Cash Movement,
checkout-side cash location picker, Dompet page, courier outstanding +
Sudah Disetor/Jadikan Kasbon) WITHOUT closing/shift blocking — Shift
itself isn't built yet, so 'Tutup Dompet' enforcement is deferred until
it exists. Couriers are manual/dummy cash_locations (Budi, Andi seeded)
since the Staff module doesn't exist yet to source a real courier list —
staff_id columns are reserved and NULL until it does.

Core principle from the PRD, followed throughout: a Paid transaction
status does not by itself mean cash is in Store Cash — cash location is
tracked separately via an append-only ledger, never a mutated balance
field. Every location's balance is always computed as SUM(movements in)
- SUM(movements out) at read time (DompetRepository.getLocationBalance),
not stored.

DB (v5): cash_locations (store/courier), cash_movements (immutable
ledger rows with audit-trail fields: type, from/to location, amount,
reference transaction/kasbon, reason, created_at/by), kasbon (staff
debt, shaped for future payroll integration), kasbon_repayments
(repayment history — remaining_balance/status only change via explicit
repayment records, never auto-marked paid).

Checkout integration: PosRepository.saveTransaction gains an optional
cashLocationId param; when provided (paid + cash amount > 0), it calls
DompetRepository.recordCashSale after the transaction/items are saved.
PaymentModal: when order type is Delivery and method is Tunai, shows
CashLocationPicker ('Uang Diterima Oleh' — Dompet Toko or a courier);
confirming payment is blocked until a location is picked in that case.
Deliberately NOT added to the Ojol payment path — Ojol settlement goes
through the delivery platform, not this app's own courier cash ledger.

New Dompet feature module:
- Domain: CashLocation/CashLocationType, CashMovement/CashMovementType,
  Kasbon/KasbonStatus/KasbonRepayment, CashLocationBalance, DompetSummary
  (three categories per PRD §23 — Uang di Dompet / Uang di Kurir /
  Kasbon Staff — deliberately never summed into one figure)
- Application: DompetRepository (all balance reads computed from
  movements, recordCashSale/recordCourierDeposit/convertToKasbon/
  recordKasbonRepayment), DompetProvider/DompetState/DompetController
- Presentation: DompetScreen (saldo card, three-category ringkasan,
  courier outstanding list, aktivitas cash in plain cashier language per
  PRD §20), CourierOutstandingCard (Sudah Disetor with partial-amount
  support per PRD §10, Jadikan Kasbon with confirmation dialog),
  CashMovementTile, CashLocationPicker (the checkout-side picker)

Wired: swipe-up menu's 'Dompet' tile now pushes DompetScreen (was a
placeholder).

Explicitly NOT in this pass (see docs/dompet-prd for full scope):
closing/'Tutup Dompet' blocking logic, shift integration, real
staff-sourced courier list, payroll deduction integration, audit trail
created_by (reserved column, NULL until Auth exists), overdue-closing
handling.
